 "notes": "DIT SA Standard Road Sign Index sheet (A4, legends and dimensions outlined, colour legend; size from the sheet's size table = register). Every dimension from the sheet; AS 1744 (plus0) spacing. R5-SA100-2N 225 x 800 (narrow format, two time periods): lane panel 410 high, parking panel 390; dividing line measured at y 387.5-392.5. Part-time lane sign with a parking panel: black lane legend above a 5 black dividing line, green parking legend below; white, R25, no border. R7-1-1 bus symbol at 40 % (175 wide, 25 margins); LANE 35 E (134: 45/134/46); hour numerals 50 E with '30' in 30 C top-aligned and AM / PM 15 E bottom-aligned; MON - FRI and SAT 20 E; 2P 100 E (24/81/15/81/24); 12 in 35 E over NOON 12 E where shown; double arrows R5-14 (155 x 32, 35 margins) — the AS 1743 arrow drawn as a polygon. The sheet dimensions the panels and line pitches; the legend blocks are given only as '195 MAX.' / 141 / 155 centred, so every element is placed where the sheet draws it (ink positions measured at 1200 dpi; the sheet is at 1:10, about +/- 1 mm). Sheet note: panel times are for illustration only — the example times are drawn, no time variants. Symbols reused from the national set (the sheet cites R7-1-1 and R5-14)."
